# Project instructions

## Stack and dependencies

- Use **vanilla JavaScript only**. No frameworks; no libraries unless explicitly requested.
- Before adding any external library or dependency, **ask first**.

## Code organization

- Keep **HTML, CSS, and JS in separate files**.
- Break JavaScript into **clear functions** and **separate files** as needed.
- **Do not duplicate logic** across the codebase.

## Style and changes

- Write **clean, readable code** with **comments** that explain what each section does.
- Prefer **simple** solutions over clever ones.
- When you make a change, **explain what you changed and why**.
- **Do not refactor** code the user did not ask to refactor.
- If something is unclear, **say so** instead of guessing.

## Visual changes

- **Test new visual changes in the browser** (e.g. Chrome with MCP when available).
